{"gal":[{"id":"gal","headword":"गल्","headword_slp1":"gal","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. √गल्, गलति\n— 1〉 herabtraufeln 251,24. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 7619","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 2〉 herabfallen, abfallen.\n— 3〉 wegfallen, verschwinden, [] verstreichen. गलित verschwunden, gewichen, nicht mehr vorhanden, fehlend. So heissen insbes. die im Padapāṭha des ṚV. weggelassenen Stellen (weil sie schon früher da waren).\n— Caus.\n— 1〉 गालयति\n — a〉 durchseihen, durchsieben.\n — b〉 flüssig machen, auflösen, schmelzen.\n — c〉 abzapfen (das Wasser eines Wassersüchtigen) "},{"t":"cite","s":"CARAKA. 6,18","q":"CARAKA"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— 2〉 *गालयते (स्रवणे).\n— Intens. जल्गल्यते etwa von sich tropfen lassen.\n— Mit अव herabfallen.\n— Mit आ, आगलित herabgefallen, — gesunken, — geflossen "},{"t":"cite","s":"KĀD. 2,121,24","q":"KĀD"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Mit पर्या ringsum herabträufeln.\n— Mit समा, ˚गलित zusammengestürzt.\n— Mit उद्\n— 1〉 hervorträufeln.\n— 2〉 herausfallen. उद्गलित "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 7865","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Mit नि Intens. ˚गल्गलीति Feuchtigkeit entlassen "},{"t":"cite","s":"VS. 23,22","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Mit निस्, निर्गलित\n— 1〉 herausgeflossen.\n— 2〉 abgesprungen, abgeflogen.\n— Caus. निर्गालित wovon man die Flüssigkeit hat abträufeln lassen.\n— Mit परि, ˚गलित\n— 1〉 ringsum herabgefallen.\n— 2〉 eingesunken in (im Comp. vorangehend).\n— Mit प्र herabtröpfeln. प्रगलित MEGH.\n— Caus. abfallen machen "},{"t":"cite","s":"CARAKA. 1,26","q":"CARAKA"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Mit वि\n— 1〉 sich ergiessen, entfliessen. विगलित zerronnen, versiegt.\n— 2〉 zerrinnen, schmelzen. ˚गलित zerflossen, geschmolzen.\n— 3〉 umstürzen, herab-, herausfallen. ˚गलित um-, herab-, herausgefallen aus (Abl.).\n— 4〉 zu Ende gehen "},{"t":"cite","s":"NAIṢ. 6,113","q":"NA"},{"t":"txt","s":". ˚गलित geschwunden, gewichen.\n— 5〉 zum Vorschein kommen. ˚गलित z. V. gekommen "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBH. 1,30,52","q":"MBH"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Mit प्रवि\n— 1〉 hervorströmen MĀLATĪ"},{"t":"cite","s":"M. 75,13","q":"M"},{"t":"txt","s":" (67,19. 162,1).\n— 2〉 schwinden, weichen MĀLATĪ"},{"t":"cite","s":"M. 69,11","q":"M"},{"t":"txt","s":" (62,9. 146,7)."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. √गल्, गलति (अदने), गलित (गिलित ?) verspeist "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 1918","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n— Mit नि verschlucken "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 1126","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":", v. l. für ˚गिलति."}]},{"n":3,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. √गल् mit विनिस् hervorbrechen PR. "},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 108","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]},{"n":4,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. √गल् mit विनिस् 3."}]}]}],"gala":[{"id":"gala","headword":"गल","headword_slp1":"gala","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. गल m. Kehle, Hals. Am Ende eines adj. Comp. f. आ (HEMĀDRI 1,434,15) und *ई."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. *गल\n— 1〉 m.\n — a〉 Harz, insbes. der Shorea robusta.\n — b〉 eine Art Goldforelle.\n — c〉 ein best. musikalisches Instrument.\n — d〉 Schilf.\n — e〉 Strick.\n— 2〉 f. आ eine der Mimosa pudica verwandte Pflanze. Richtig मेदोगला."}]}]},{"id":"galla","headword":"गल्ल","headword_slp1":"galla","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"गल्ल m. Backe, Wange."}]}]},{"id":"gAla","headword":"गाल","headword_slp1":"gAla","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"गाल Adj. mit der Kehle hervorgebracht."}]}]}],"galaka":[{"id":"galaka","headword":"गलक","headword_slp1":"galaka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. गलक m. Kehle, Hals."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. *गलक m. eine Art Goldforelle."}]}]},{"id":"gallaka","headword":"गल्लक","headword_slp1":"gallaka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"गल्लक = गल्वर्क 2〉 "},{"t":"cite","s":"HARṢAC. 184,14","q":"HARṢAC"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"galakambala":[{"id":"galakambala","headword":"गलकम्बल","headword_slp1":"galakambala","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"*गलकम्बल m. Wamme."}]}]}],"galagaRqa":[{"id":"galagaRqa","headword":"गलगण्ड","headword_slp1":"galagaRqa"